00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:14.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
They used to be my only source
of stories for programs

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
like this, but now
I can´t do it anymore,

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they catch me.
-Oh, they don´t...

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.020 size:81% position:41%
-Like, Alice came home
one day and was like,

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.890
"Hey, a friend of mine´s sister
showed me, like,

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
a long YouTube video of
you telling stories about me

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
