00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:31.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
#Fakenews.

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.268 size:75% position:38%
But yeah, it´s cool.

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:37.704
You´ll see like, you know, Ash,
like, when he gets bigger,

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.672
you get so excited that you get
really like, "I´m gonna..."

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.008
They´re bigger, "I´m going to
show you ´Back to the Future.´"

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:43.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You get to show them movies

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.577 size:88% position:44%
