She -- Over one summer,

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:52.919
she binge-watched all of
"The Andy Griffith Show" twice.

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:55.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
That´s a real deep cut.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.323
-That´s a deep cut.
All of "The Dick Van Dyke Show."

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, these are
fundamental principles.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:01.995 size:81% position:41%
-I mean, just to go --
A kid in today´s age,

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:04.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
to say "I will watch
black and white comedy."

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. Black and white --
gentle black and white comedy.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.133
-Gentle black and white comedy.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:10.336 size:88% position:44%
-Yeah, She watched all
of the American "Office"

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:11.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
