-Great.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:12.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I was like,
those little seasons were,

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, 26 episodes.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.976
-Yeah.
-She watched it in like, a week.

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:19.012
And she came to me and she was
like, "What should I watch now?"

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:21.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"Well, you´re 12 now.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:23.983
A lot of people like ´30 Rock.´"

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:28.021
So she goes to watch "30 Rock,"
and she watched a couple

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:30.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she came back out to me
and she was like,

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.392 size:88% position:44%
