make you feel weird

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:36.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
´cause Mommy had to,
I don´t know, like, pretend to

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:38.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
be in love with somebody
who wasn´t Daddy?"

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:41.468
And she was just like, "No,
it´s just too weird for me."

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.636 size:84% position:42%
And I was like, "Oh,
you mean like tonally."

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:45.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.140
And so I was like, "Okay."
So, I had to take that hit.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, that was
a hard motherly hit...

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:50.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-...to take.

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:51.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she´s like,
"So, what should I watch?"

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.513 size:81% position:41%
And, I was like, well,
you know, what about

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
´Parks and Recreation´?
You might really like that."

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:57.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she was like, "Oh,
I watched all of it already."

00:01:57.417 --> 00:01:59.886 size:84% position:42%
And then, it´s so hard
for me not to be, like,

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:03.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Get in your room
and watch ´30 Rock.´"

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.558 size:81% position:41%
I was gonna spank her.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.660 size:81% position:41%
I felt like that woman
