00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:14.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"You come to <i>me </i>for that!

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don´t go to Aunt Amy
and Mike Schur!"

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:17.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
