00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:20.340
-"I just like my ensemble comedy
from Aunt Amy."

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"I like a gentle Mike Schur
sensibility.

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:24.511
´30 Rock´ is overstuffed."

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:25.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, fine.
-Did you --

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:29.048
Have they seen previews of
the early work of "Mean Girls"?

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, they´ve been coming
