00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:34.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
That is exciting, because
that is the first thing that

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:37.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jeff and I have done that
they are truly excited about.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s great.
-And the little one came

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:42.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
and watched, you know,
a full run-through last spring

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:45.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
and at six years old --
at five then --

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:47.233
