00:02:56.743 --> 00:03:00.280
I was like, no, you gotta --
It´s very positive at its core.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.048 size:88% position:44%
A very positive message.

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:03.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
Nope.
