-Yes, yeah.

00:03:11.558 --> 00:03:13.660
-Yeah, well, I will do the same.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:14.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much for being
here, and congrats.

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:15.995 size:88% position:44%
